# ProjectHub API requests. In Rider: start the API (Run or Debug, "http" profile), then click the green
# arrow next to any request. Each "###" starts a new request. Expected status codes are in the titles.

@host = http://localhost:5064

### 200: list of project summaries
GET {{host}}/api/projects

### 200: one project with its tasks (status as text: "Todo", "InProgress", "Done")
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1

### 404: no such project
GET {{host}}/api/projects/999

### 404 with an empty body: "abc" doesn't match the {id:int} route constraint, so no action is found
GET {{host}}/api/projects/abc

### 201 Created + Location header: create a project
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Docs portal",
  "description": "Public API docs"
}

### 409 Conflict: the name is taken (case-insensitive)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "WEBSITE REDESIGN"
}

### 400: our business rule (empty after trimming)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "   "
}

### 400: automatic model validation by [ApiController] ("name" is a non-nullable string, so it is required)
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "no name"
}

### 200: update project 4 (create it first with the POST above)
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Docs portal v2",
  "description": "Renamed"
}

### 409: project 4 may not take ANOTHER project's name
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mobile app"
}

### 404: update a project that doesn't exist
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ghost"
}

### 201 Created: add a task to project 4
POST {{host}}/api/projects/4/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write getting started"
}

### 404: add a task to a project that doesn't exist
POST {{host}}/api/projects/999/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ghost task"
}

### 204 No Content: delete project 4
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/4

### 404: delete it again
DELETE {{host}}/api/projects/4
